  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "しげみの　かげに　かくれて　くらす。\nてきに　おそわれると　からだの　けを\nするどく　さかだてて　いかくする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "수풀의 그늘에 숨어 산다.\n적에게 공격당하면 몸의 털을\n뾰족하게 곤두세우며 위협한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vit caché sous le couvert des buissons.\nPoursuivi par un ennemi, il tente de l’intimider\nen hérissant les poils qui lui couvrent le corps.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es lebt versteckt im schattigen Dickicht. Wird es\nvon einem Feind angegriffen, stellt es sein Fell\nzur Abschreckung zu scharfen Spitzen auf.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Habita en la sombra de la espesura. Si percibe alguna\namenaza, su pelaje se eriza y se vuelve muy afilado\npara así intimidar al enemigo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive nascosto nella boscaglia. Se attaccato, minaccia\ni nemici rizzando il pelo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It lives hidden within thicket shadows.\nWhen predators attack, it quickly bristles the fur\ncovering its body in an effort to threaten them.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "しげみの　陰に　隠れて　暮らす。\n敵に　襲われると　体の　毛を\n鋭く　逆立てて　威嚇する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Habita en la sombra de la espesura. Si percibe alguna\namenaza, su pelaje se eriza y se vuelve muy afilado\npara así intimidar al enemigo.",
